  "frontier_delta_g3gg": "UST.G3GG selects one common115-row minor of the210x132 second-jet operator. Adding16 zero-chart equations and c10=1 gives a fixed132-square invertible system on48 archived fibers. G3GM independently replays the same formula at a correctly evaluated p79903,gamma12863 anchor with profile4748/1274. Thus c=adj(M2)e132/det(M2) exactly at49 valid fibers, while operator promotion over Q(gamma) remains open.",
