  "frontier_delta_g3ce": "UST.G3CE proves that the 1261-square lower H11+H02 block of the G3CD operator has determinant 4 modulo 11 and eliminates it reversibly for the static rank/cokernel problem. The emitted 248-square Schur operator has rank 247, a nonzero 247 minor and a unique cokernel; the selected effective source retains pairing 2 and raises the 249-square affine rank to 248. Both reduced null witnesses reconstruct the full G3CD witnesses exactly. Static matrix equivalence is closed; dynamic ODE reduction, characteristic-zero Schur rank, horizontal integration, integral marking and beta_C remain open.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cf": "UST.G3CF proves that the nonzero canonical lower-block determinant and every parent-chart denominator are rational over Q(gamma)(a), while every interior G3BJ path value is transcendental. The static Schur gauge therefore covers every 0<t<=1 point with no interior atlas or determinant enumeration. G3BN/G3BR already close the parent charts at a=1; J(1), coefficient execution and dynamic reduction remain open.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cg": "UST.G3CG proves that the frozen G3CE graph is not invariant under the terminal affine connection: its homogeneous tangency defect has rank 247 and its selected affine defect rank 248. It emits the exact nonzero Riccati jet targets X'=-XS and y'=-Xb_eff. Rank-249 transport is therefore conditional on matching actual family jets and proving the identities pathwise; otherwise the selected rank-1510 affine continuation remains mandatory.",
  "frontier_delta_g3ch": "UST.G3CH proves that X_H02 is invertible with determinant 10 modulo 11 and uses the unique solution of X_H02 v=y_H02 to cancel the unknown H02 connection derivative. Exact dual-number differentiation of only the H20 and H11 recursive chains emits L'v and J'w. The combined Riccati equations force a unique 1261-entry source jet with 1147 nonzeros, so the constant B103-coordinate source extension is rejected entrywise. The theorem is a necessary first-order cutset and does not select the required nonzero jet or prove pathwise transport.",
  "frontier_delta_g3ci": "UST.G3CI differentiates the exact G3CA source polynomial through the selected H02 and recursive H11 charts. Its H02 terminal anchor matches G3CC exactly, but the full rational reduction has 920 H11 anchor entries and is not the G3CD source. The associated-graded H02 continuation anchors G3CD exactly but its source jet differs from the unique G3CH target in 1139 entries. The current selected source therefore rejects the rank-249 Schur-Riccati shortcut at first order. An engineered non-graded lift is not excluded but requires an independent selection theorem; otherwise full rank-1510 continuation is mandatory.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cj": "UST.G3CJ reconstructs all 1509 columns [b,Kb,...,K^1508b] and proves determinant 7 modulo 11. The selected source is therefore cyclic and every Krylov prefix has maximal rank. The unique degree-1509 recurrence has 1384 nonzero coefficients with c0=0 and c1=8. The 1510-column affine frame has determinant 4 and minimal polynomial x times the homogeneous polynomial. This proves the full affine carrier is minimal among fixed linear source-reachable invariant realizations; it is a companion coordinate theorem, not a dimension reduction.",
  "frontier_delta_g3ck": "UST.G3CK promotes the nonzero terminal Krylov determinant to an exact characteristic zero domain theorem. Because K(a), b(a) and their Krylov determinant are rational over Q(gamma)(a), every zero or pole is algebraic; the transcendental G3BJ path therefore gives a cyclic full-carrier gauge for every 0<t<=1. The transformed rank-1510 equation retains the moving-frame term B_aff^-1 dB_aff/da. The algebraic start a=1 and explicit coefficient execution remain open.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cl": "UST.G3CL combines the globally regular fixed B103 parent frame on 0<=t<=1 with the G3CK cyclic frame on 0<t<=1. Their rational invertible transition gives a two-gauge atlas, so start cyclicity is not a transport prerequisite and Delta_Kr(1) is optional. The named exit is now a source-specific characteristic-zero or certified interval action oracle for K_tilde, equivalently C_aff-Omega_aff, followed by integration and integral readout.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cm": "UST.G3CM replays all 1509 selected-source Krylov columns and the terminal recurrence exactly through a matrix-free sum of the three Hodge-sector blocks, with zero mismatch and without loading the dense operator. Linearity reduces each family RHS evaluation from 1509 materialized columns to three combined return chains. Carrier dimension remains 1509. The missing production lane is the characteristic-zero or interval H02 pole-six recursive action on the evolving state.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cn": "UST.G3CN constructs exact family updates on all 30 targeted transform charts and solves their first jets at GF(11) with zero residual. The updates touch 287275 selected columns; 28 groups emit 15211 nonzero quotient-coordinate entries. This rejects unchanged promotion of the frozen 225-generator transform but does not obstruct the complete pole-six target.",
  "frontier_delta_g3co": "UST.G3CO proves the complete 208570 by 602597 degree-(9,1,3) original-Jacobian map is surjective on every 0<t<=1 path point. A nonzero B89 maximal minor has only algebraic roots, all avoided by the transcendental interior. Exact finite right-inverse existence and zero cutoff error are closed on the open arc; action execution and the raw a=1 presentation remain open.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cp": "UST.G3CP proves that the smooth proper start and regular G3CL standard frame force a regular Gauss-Manin connection at a=1. Any apparent start pole in a complete G3CO rational reduction is removable. The raw unsaturated start rank is no longer a transport-existence prerequisite. A strict schema now accepts only an exact canceled start limit or a directed-rounding interval ball, together with a zero-residual embedding of z4=-delta tensor u_B.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cq": "UST.G3CQ contracts the exact selected source through all G3CN quotient jets. Its 705-term defect is nonzero, but complete reduction uses 107 generators all inside the frozen 225 support. The transform therefore emits the exact ten-row correction; its 62053 terms have a 11222-term minus divergence and 229-coordinate H02 normal form.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cr": "UST.G3CR propagates the selected quotient-defect correction exactly through H02, H11 and H20. All three coordinate equations have zero residual and the terminal divergence vanishes, yielding one 1509-coordinate vector with 1360 nonzero entries.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cs": "UST.G3CS composes 3758824 selected image-coordinate jet entries with the exact LS rows and adds the quotient correction. The resulting ten-row derivative has 60708 terms and satisfies Jprime*h0+J*hprime=0 exactly. Its complete H02 return derivative has 11236 ambient terms and 217 nonzero B103 coordinates.",
  "frontier_delta_g3ct": "UST.G3CT solves the complete differentiated selected connection action through H02, H11 and H20, including all G3BK chart derivatives. Every reconstruction residual is zero. The resulting one-source Kprime(0)b has 1381 nonzero entries in 1509 B103 coordinates; the quotient-correction-only vector differs in 1379 coordinates.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cu": "UST.G3CU reconstructs the selected H11 affine update over Q(gamma). Its exact support has matching bound 1006. Exact number-field elimination finds three 162x198 blocks of rank 147 rather than 150 and three 108x108 blocks of rank 93 rather than 96. A 988-square minor has determinant 13318 modulo 21817, so rank_Q(gamma)(Delta_H11)=988 exactly, replacing the former 982-to-1006 interval.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cv": "UST.G3CV selects the G3CU rank-revealing rows and columns and emits exact polynomial matrices U, S and W with shapes 4426x988, 988x988 and 988x4426. The nonzero S minor and exact rank prove Delta_H11=U*S^-1*W over Q(gamma), and componentwise split-place replay has zero mismatch. The H11 family solve is now the explicit reduced equation (S+a*W*P)z=a*W*x0 with P=A0^-1*U and x0=A0^-1*b still to be evaluated.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cw": "UST.G3CW applies each of the six hash-certified B89 H11 charts modulo 21817 to all 988 G3CV update columns. It emits the 4426x988x6 residue of P=A0^-1*U and the 988x988x6 residue Q=W*P with zero solve and interpolation residuals. All six S, S+Q and corrected endpoint determinants are nonzero, and det(A1)det(S)=det(A0)det(S+Q) holds independently at every root. The reduced H11 kernel is therefore executed exactly at one complete split place; characteristic-zero/Arb promotion and x0 remain open.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cx": "UST.G3CX proves the exact H11 source-observation corridor in the B89 DM DAG. It has 394 components and dimension 2786, exactly the two cores 1710 and 684 plus 392 singletons. The corridor forces 248 Q columns to vanish over Q(gamma), leaving 740; the six good-reduction ranks are all 710, giving the rigorous interval 710<=rank_Q(gamma)(Q)<=740. Full P recovery needs only the 4013-dimensional U-ancestor cone after one combined RHS is formed.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cy": "UST.G3CY forms the exact-support bordered matrix [[A0,U],[W,0]]. Its maximum matching and explicit minimum vertex cover both have size 5136, so the Schur rank identity bounds rank_Q(gamma)(Q) by 710. A selected 710-square good-reduction minor has determinant 17520 modulo 21817, giving the matching lower bound. Therefore rank_Q(gamma)(W*A0^-1*U)=710 exactly, and the selected minor defines a minimal second Woodbury reduction of the H11 path kernel.",
  "frontier_delta_g3cz": "UST.G3CZ evaluates the exact 1710-dimensional H11 DM core on all 499 selected G3CY minor columns supported there. On embedding 4, all 853290 directed-rounding residual balls contain zero and the complete 1710x499 action is persisted with at least 80 portable enclosure bits. Rational-polynomial conjugation supplies embedding 5 without another solve.",
  "frontier_delta_g3da": "UST.G3DA executes all 392 scalar blocks and the 684-dimensional core downstream of G3CZ. All 290080 scalar and 506160 core residual balls contain zero. It persists Q on all 740 exact nonzero columns with shape 988x740; G3CX supplies the other 248 exact zero columns. The selected 710x710 T_Q determinant ball excludes zero both in the builder and an independent archive replay, closing the characteristic-zero reduced-coupling values on embeddings 4 and 5.",
  "frontier_delta_g3db": "UST.G3DB solves S*P_Q=Q[:,C] with all 701480 residual balls containing zero and persists P_Q and R_Q=Q[R,:]*P_Q. The exact 710x710 path pencil K_710(a)=T_Q+aR_Q is numerically invertible at a=0, exactly invertible at a=1 by the G3CW/G3CV/G3CY determinant chain, and avoids every algebraic zero on the transcendental G3BJ interior. Thus the source-independent H11 path kernel is closed on embeddings 4 and 5.",
  "frontier_delta_g3dc": "UST.G3DC reconstructs the complete affine H20-to-H11 source B_B89+aB_C from the two hash-bound source theorems and certifies A0^-1*B_B89 and A0^-1*B_C on embeddings 4 and 5. The exact DM solve accounts for all 2195296 equations as 1542277 zero-containing Arb residuals plus 653019 structural zeros. Both 4426x248 maps are persisted with at least 107 portable accuracy bits and use zero fitted source values.",
  "frontier_delta_g3dd": "UST.G3DD contracts both G3DC maps through W and solves S*Z=W*X with all 490048 residual balls containing zero. The G3CY-selected Q rows then emit H_B89 and H_C with shape 710x248 and at least 77 portable accuracy bits. The complete selected source equation is (T_Q+aR_Q)q=a^2*(H_B89+aH_C)c20(a); only the selected coupled state and downstream validation remain on this embedding pair.",
  "frontier_delta_g3de": "UST.G3DE turns the exact G3BZ rank statement into the executable identity Delta_H02,C=U*S^-1*W. All 18 polynomial coefficient matrices are persisted, the selected 6022-minor is 10028 modulo 21817, and 34 exact component replays reconstruct the full update with zero mismatch. The 42458-dimensional varying solve is therefore reduced exactly to a 6022-dimensional kernel once the B89 inverse actions are supplied.",
  "frontier_delta_g3df": "UST.G3DF proves that Q=W*A0^-1*U is confined to one exact 24767-dimensional H02 DM core and that one-vector recovery needs only 24861 directions. It removes 17691 complement directions, but all 6022 rows and columns of Q remain structurally active. Any smaller kernel now requires coefficient-rank or selected-state evidence, not another support-only search.",
  "frontier_delta_g3dg": "UST.G3DG executes the full 30789-square H02 bordered coupling at the split place (21817,5). Exact rank 29515 gives rank(Q)=4748. A certified support matching of size 29990 gives the characteristic-zero interval 4748<=rank_Q(gamma)(Q)<=5223; no equality is inferred from one finite root.",
  "frontier_delta_g3dh": "UST.G3DH repeats the exact bordered elimination at all six roots modulo 21817. Every core is invertible, every bordered rank is 29515, every coupling rank is 4748, and every root has the same selected/dependent coordinate sets. This excludes a root-specific specialization but remains one-prime split-algebra evidence.",
  "frontier_delta_g3di": "UST.G3DI replaces rank-only evidence by all 1274 normalized triangular kernel relations at every root modulo 21817. Every complete 30789-row bordered residual is zero, the six roots interpolate to one 6022x1274 degree-less-than-six split-algebra kernel, and an independent exact solver obtains zero QN residual on spread sample columns.",
