  "frontier_delta_g3ea": "UST.G3EA proves that the restricted gradient presentation M9(P,T)=grad(C0) dot P-C0*T has exact rank359 and kernel166 over Q(gamma). Its elliptic lift satisfies A0*L+U*N=embed(M9)*t0^3*s^2 and W*L=0, proving component9 rank169 and tightening the global Q rank interval to4748..5112; the remaining gap is364.",
